{"t":"Charles","s":"charles-39942","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_6_f8482d.png","q":18,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Charles</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPort Hope\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Map</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"posx\"><center><div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145804&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_6_f8482d.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32529,32785,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32529, 32785, 6)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ship Captain</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.5<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 09, 2005<br/>Summer Update 2005</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221211090742&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Charles_1fc479.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Charles.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Passages to Thais, Darashia, Edron, Venore, Ankrahmun, Liberty Bay, Oramond and Yalahar.</li><li>Ahoy. Where can I sail you today?</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Western end of <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a>, on the boat.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Admires <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a> very much. \n</p><p>Charles also offers shortcuts to a few destinations which are cheaper. However, you might get shipwrecked and end up in a different place when using them:\n</p>\n<ul><li>An island west of the Meluna, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32024,32461,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32024, 32461, 7)</a>, as part of <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Secret%20Library%20Quest\">The Secret Library Quest</a>. After using the ship's telescope (during night) and getting the Hawser (Item) from the heap of rubbish, use the hawser on the raft and you will get sent to <a href=\"#/wiki/Fibula\">Fibula</a>.</li>\n<li>A small island, part of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Islands\">Ice Islands</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32113,31742,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32113, 31742, 7)</a>, where you can find <a href=\"#/wiki/Arctic%20Faun\">Arctic Fauns</a>. You can leave the island through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Portal\">Ice Portal</a>, which brings you to <a href=\"#/wiki/Vega\">Vega</a>, north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>, north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Fibula\">Fibula</a> or the south shore of <a href=\"#/wiki/Ragnir\">Ragnir</a>.</li>\n<li>A small island north of Feyrist, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33462,32159,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33462, 32159, 7)</a>, where you can face <a href=\"#/wiki/Raxias\">Raxias</a> when going in the teleporter. You get sent to <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>'s temple after using the <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Shrine\">Energy Shrine</a> there.</li>\n<li>A small island in the middle of the three <a href=\"#/wiki/Laguna%20Islands\">Laguna Islands</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32456,32938,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32456, 32938, 7)</a>. You will find a dead human. Use it to gain a <a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">shovel</a>. You can use that shovel on a hole next to it. Below, you find a small cave with a seashell and a dead explorer, in which you can find a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fishing%20Rod\">Fishing Rod</a>. There is some water inside the cave where you can fish in. You can leave this island by walking on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Turtle\">turtle</a>, which will bring you to <a href=\"#/wiki/Meriana\">Meriana</a>. If you don't have access to <a href=\"#/wiki/Meriana\">Meriana</a> yet, you will need to have a fish in your backpack for the turtle, which you can loot from the crab on the island or catch with the fishing rod and worms. Worms can be dug up from the sand by using the shovel.</li></ul>\n<p>After shipwrecking on one of these locations, you cannot use the shortcut from Charles for 20 hours.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Passage to</th>\n<th>Cost (gp)</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">110</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">180</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">150</td>\n<td>Shortcut cost: 90\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">50</td>\n<td>Shortcut cost: 20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond\">Oramond</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">200</td>\n<td>Rank of \"Citizen\" in the <a href=\"#/quest/rathleton-quest\">Rathleton Quest</a> required.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">160</td>\n<td>Shortcut cost: 100\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Travora</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">1,000</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">160</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">260</td>\n<td>Shortcut cost: 200\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><small>Completing the Postman Quest gives 10 gp discount to most destinations.</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["a-fathers-burden-quest","ancient-aucar-outfits-quest","cartography-101-quest","chakoya-iceberg-mini-world-change","druid-outfits-quest","elephant-tusk-quest","grimvale-quest","hydra-egg-quest","jungle-camp-mini-world-change","knight-outfits-quest","secret-service-quest","shaman-outfits-quest","stampede-mini-world-change","swamp-fever-world-change","the-ape-city-quest","twisted-waters-world-change","waterfall-quest","wrath-of-the-emperor-quest"],"pos":{"x":32529,"y":32785,"z":6}}